 "level_notes": {
  "0": "Rakudo is the main compiler, written largely in NQP and Raku and targeting MoarVM (also JVM/JS backends). The roast test suite is the normative specification: a Raku version is defined as the set of roast tests it must pass.",
  "1": "The 2000-2004 Apocalypses/Exegeses/Synopses were the original design documents and are now historical; docs.raku.org is the official language reference.",
  "3": "Rosetta Code reports 'blocked' to automated checkers."
 },
